# Festival of Embers' permission is "by paying 1 life in addition to their other costs" (CR 118.8, 601.2b), and a player can pay
# life only if their life total is at least the payment (CR 119.4). Turn 1 Bot1 casts Lightning Bolt (Bot2 17), which goes to the
# graveyard; turn 3 it casts the Festival with the five Moxen. Turn 7 it casts Lich with the Swamp and a Dark Ritual: Bot1 loses
# all 20 life and stays in the game at 0 (Lich). With {R} floating, the Bolt in its graveyard may not be cast by the Festival's
# permission, since its total cost, {R} and 1 life, can't be paid (CR 601.2f-h): a cast by the way is offered only for a total its
# caster can pay. The positive control is festival-of-embers-casts-an-instant-from-your-graveyard-for-its-cost-and-1-life-and-exiles-it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Lightning Bolt
Swamp
Festival of Embers
Lich
Dark Ritual
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Festival of Embers.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dark Ritual.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lich.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Life = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
! Bot1.Graveyard.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2; Ability: During your turn)

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 0
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
